      "uid": "zhcn:e678758d769d0485e4ade0d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毫无疑问，情况已经恶化到了不可接受的程度。\r\n……因为过度的训练和某件事造成的打击，\r\n爱慕织姬的身体与精神都已经濒临崩溃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e58c782b7fc51c01c658ddd15be42df1ddab14e6e07f8745a442c8d8143743bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
