    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbdc7e0186e6692ed76bc78f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……现在是训练员的管辖时间之外。\n在自由时间里要做什么是我的事情，与你无关。",
      "source_fingerprint": "877df3b1ed71da6230cff740e72e565f2cbafc0752b81b71a91197f3ae0f0d76",
