    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c2675cafa808935bac41bdd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因骨骼歪曲而承担着天生的负担，\r\n再加上如今爱织毫不节制的训练……\r\n她的左脚，现在应该正处于崩溃边缘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0993f8c5fe42daddb05ef7f253b7a7e641b731429d98319d65798e992d2616f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
